      "statement": "The MCP HTTP server wraps the official TypeScript MCP SDK Streamable HTTP transport; Brijio owns the HTTP boundary (path matching, origin allowlist, bearer auth, method guard) and page/WebSocket routing, while the SDK owns protocol framing, initialization, and tool/resource dispatch.",
      "evidence": [
